<title>USA: Banco Frances Q1 net rises.</title>
<headline>Banco Frances Q1 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> ADS			  $0.43		    $0.28</p>
<p> Shr			   0.14		     0.09</p>
<p> Net			 20,945		   13,887</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Each ADS represents three ordinary shares.</p>
<p>Each period assumes 147.5 million shares outstanding.</p>
<p>Q1 net financial income $52.7 million vs $46.2 million.  </p>
<p>Total assets: $4.75 billion vs 3.28 billion</p>
<p>The full name of the company is Banco Frances del Rio de la Plata SA.</p>
